Signed PawnIO modules from the official repository, belonging to the 0.2.11 release:

https://github.com/namazso/PawnIO.Modules/releases/tag/0.2.11

Embedded unmodified in fanrgb.exe; src/hw/pawnio.rs pins their SHA-256:

  LpcIO.bin        b3896a1cab0d808fca31fe2ebcae045d59dac690da87b17c858bb8da357eb45e
  AMDFamily17.bin  dae74615761b78bdf064dfb3e136252ddcc6fc727d88f14738d0e5800d427a91

Checked on 2026-11-12: both are byte-identical to the files in the official release asset
release_0_2_11.zip (sha256 43608cb89bc84247fef1368a139013f7d043e17db6d6c8dfc9b46bf0905a81f4).

